---
import PageLayout from "../../../components/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout lang="en" active="roadmap" title="Release Log — Linxira OS" maxWidth="860px">
  <h1>Release Log</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Released ISO builds. The current image is 2026-10-26; Arch is a rolling release, so old images are not retained or offered.</p>
  <div class="section-divider"></div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.10.26-x86_64.iso</code>
      <span class="tag latest">Latest</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-10-26 · 5.0 GB · SHA256 <code class="sha">4111d82b033293c85f7a11c609fc777a367799488e576771d4d39bfcbe43d09e</code></div>
    <ul>
      <li>Crash watch 0.1.1 with the diagnose-crash skill ships on the image</li>
      <li>Desktops narrowed to Plasma + COSMIC; headless in two sizes (full / minimal)</li>
      <li>Zeta preinstalled on desktop installs and upgraded through update</li>
      <li>catalog 3.6.0 / components 0.8.3 / config-hub 2.5.3 / package-center 0.2.4</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.14-x86_64.iso</code>
      <span class="tag stable">Experimental Stable</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-14 · 4.79 GB · SHA256 <code class="sha">b85ffcea99b39402470868a2d63d330613d12ec4068c57b92286a19e403bd145</code></div>
    <ul>
      <li>93 curated apps (catalog v3) across 14 categories; scientific computing and gaming ships by default</li>
      <li>Dual kernel (linux + linux-lts) with Timeshift / grub-btrfs snapshot rollback</li>
      <li>Containers by default: Podman / Distrobox / Apptainer / Docker out of the box</li>
      <li>Headless compute mode: linxira-config headless on/off — zero desktop overhead, all RAM for compute</li>
      <li>Signed [linxira] repository with 17 first-party tools; Chinese IME auto-configured by install language</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.13-x86_64.iso</code>
      <span class="tag beta">Test</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-13 · 4.79 GB · SHA256 <code class="sha">b880391c29f96b6fc3c71d17be7ed6eb7248c6e0bb9021c6ccce522431f34d6b</code></div>
    <ul>
      <li>Incremental fixes over 08.12: boot / shutdown artwork and terminal char-art finalized</li>
      <li>All first-party software verified installable and launchable</li>
      <li>Signed repository update chain (pacman) trackable</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal reveal-d2">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.12-x86_64.iso</code>
      <span class="tag beta">Test</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-12 · 4.73 GB · SHA256 not separately archived</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Test baseline: KDE Plasma desktop + preinstalled software usable offline</li>
      <li>China mirror auto-fallback + [linxira] database pre-sync during install</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal reveal-d3">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.09-x86_64-r17.iso</code>
      <span class="tag rc">RC</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-09 · 4.69 GB</div>
    <ul>
      <li>17th iteration candidate: installer, branding and default app set converged</li>
      <li>Predecessor to the 08.12 test baseline</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Cadence and update frequency</h2>
  <p>Only images actually uploaded to the cloud count as released; internal builds are not part of the release record. Images ship as monthly batches; packages roll with Arch, so the signed <code>[linxira]</code> repository can be updated at any time; the WSL image follows each batch.</p>
  <table class="hist-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Build date</th><th>Since previous</th><th>Type</th><th>Cloud</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>2026-10-26</td><td>26 days</td><td>Monthly image (current)</td><td class="cur">Uploading</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2026-10-25</td><td>26 days</td><td>WSL image (current)</td><td class="cur">Released</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2026-09-30</td><td>1 day</td><td>Fix round r17</td><td>Withdrawn</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2026-09-29</td><td>8 days</td><td>WSL v1.1</td><td>Withdrawn</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2026-09-29</td><td>8 days</td><td>Fix round r14</td><td>Not released</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2026-09-21</td><td>38 days</td><td>Fix rounds r2–r4</td><td>Not released</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2026-08-09 → 08-14</td><td>1–3 days</td><td>Daily iteration / test baseline</td><td>Not released</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Upload history (old builds deleted)</h2>
  <p>These builds were uploaded at the dates shown and have all been deleted since. Every download site keeps <b>only the newest release and its assets</b>: the system is a rolling Arch release, old images are no longer maintained, and support requests for them are not accepted.</p>
  <table class="hist-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Date</th><th>Size</th><th>SHA256</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.10.26</td><td>2026-10-26</td><td>5.33 GB</td><td><code>4111d82b…</code></td><td class="cur">Latest (kept)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-wsl-2026.10.25</td><td>2026-10-25</td><td>566 MB</td><td><code>c9c5ed9e…</code></td><td class="cur">Latest (kept)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.30-r17</td><td>2026-09-30</td><td>5.14 GB</td><td><code>9162b270…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.29-r14</td><td>2026-09-29</td><td>4.8 GiB</td><td><code>f9413317…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.29-r13</td><td>2026-09-29</td><td>—</td><td><code>31fd005c…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.29-r12</td><td>2026-09-29</td><td>—</td><td><code>174acbe2…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-wsl-2026.09.29</td><td>2026-09-29</td><td>488 MB</td><td><code>b5b7b485…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.28</td><td>2026-09-28</td><td>—</td><td><code>63a20c95…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.27</td><td>2026-09-27</td><td>—</td><td><code>1f832cc3…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.08.14</td><td>2026-08-14</td><td>4.79 GB</td><td><code>b85ffcea…</code></td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--faint);">2026-08-14 is the earliest test build: features were incomplete — it only validated that installation completes and that some first-party system software starts.</p>

  <h2>Internal builds (never uploaded)</h2>
  <p>These images were only produced on the build machine and were never uploaded, so they are not release records and are not offered for download. Listed for internal traceability only.</p>
  <table class="hist-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Date</th><th>Size</th><th>SHA256</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.21r4</td><td>2026-09-21</td><td>4.74 GiB</td><td><code>b36aec3b…</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.21r3</td><td>2026-09-21</td><td>4.74 GiB</td><td><code>4dfb2e87…</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.09.21r2</td><td>2026-09-21</td><td>5.05 GiB</td><td><code>d5e1e308…</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.08.13</td><td>2026-08-13</td><td>4.79 GB</td><td><code>b880391c…</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.08.12</td><td>2026-08-12</td><td>4.73 GB</td><td>Not archived</td></tr>
      <tr><td>linxira-2026.08.09-r17</td><td>2026-08-09</td><td>4.69 GB</td><td>Not archived</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:2.5rem;">
    <a href="/en/download/" class="cta-ghost">Download latest ISO →</a>
  </div>

  <style>
    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .rel-item { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.6), rgba(14,20,23,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-left: 3px solid var(--teal); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem; margin: 1.2rem 0; }
    .rel-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .rel-name { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-strong); background: none; padding: 0; }
    .rel-meta { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.82rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .sha { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--soft); background: rgba(30,41,59,0.9); padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; word-break: break-all; }
    .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.12rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 600; }
    .tag.latest { background: rgba(32,184,176,0.2); color: #4DD8D0; }
    .tag.stable { background: rgba(32,184,176,0.28); color: #5EEAD4; border: 1px solid rgba(32,184,176,0.4); }
    .tag.beta { background: rgba(234,179,8,0.15); color: #FACC15; }
    .tag.rc { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.15); color: #94a3b8; }
    .rel-item ul { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; margin: 0.3rem 0 0; }
    .cta-ghost { display: inline-block; padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; color: var(--ink-strong); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .cta-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--teal); }
    .hist-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0 1.6rem; font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .hist-table th { text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem; color: var(--faint); font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
    .hist-table td { padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.35); vertical-align: top; }
    .hist-table code { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--soft); }
    .hist-table .cur { color: #4DD8D0; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</PageLayout>
